 <h3><u>Aagayai shaam se</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Aagayai shaam se</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Aa gai sham se lo aapki hamsheer hussain <br> Marsiya karti he ye zainabe dilgeer hussain</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p><br> (Aap mehroome kafan aur mein mehroome rida) x2<br> Who naseeb apka aur ye meri taqdeer hussain </p> <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Shaam ki galiyon se guzri sare darbaar gayi<br> Koi kehsakta nahin teri behan haar gayi<br> (Haaye be makna o chaadar bhi na dastaar gayi) x2<br> Phir bhi kab dil se miti aapki tasweer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Rah mein khushk na hopaye mere deedae nam<br> Mein zabaa(n) band bhi karlun to shahannshahe umam<br> (Eik ik zakhm sunayega who rudade sitam) x2<br> Who safar pusht pe durron se he tehreer hussain </li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Teri ghurbat pe fida ey mere mazloom akhi<br> Waqt ik aisa bhi aya ke behan kaamp gayi<br> (Hukm bachhi ki kaneezi ka suna ta tha shaqi) x2<br> Bas usi waqt to ghabrayi thi hamsheer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Tey safar kaise huwa kaise mein batlaun bhala<br> Koi hodaj thi na mehmil na amaari na rida<br> (Bas isi dard se khu(n) rota raha zainul iba) x2<br> Who jo rota to buka karti thi zanjeer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Jis ko suraj ne nahi dekha tha na sar nange kabhi<br> Sham ki galiyon mein sar nange wohi shehzaadi<br> (Eik chadar ki talabgaar laeeno(n) se huwi) x2<br> Royi neze pe meri chaadar-e-tatheer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Karbala hogayi aabad luti ale nabi<br> Haaye islah na ki ummat se ye soghat mili<br> (Be ghari nawha gari aho buka sina zani) x2<br> Kya yahi ajre risalat ki he tafseer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Rah mein ale payambar ka dilasa mein bani<br> Sham ke log tamashai tamasha mein bani<br> (Teri rudade masaib ka khulasa mein bani) x2<br> Khwabe ajdad ko yun milgayi tabeer hussain </li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Mein bohot royi sakina ko wahan dafna kar<br> Kaam ye pehla kiya hukme rihai paa kar<br> (Qaid khaane mein tera farshe aza bichwakar) x2<br> Tere chehlum ke liye aagayi dilgeer hussain</li>
    <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p>
    <li>Shiddate gham se utha farsh-e-aza par kohraam<br> Bas yahi mazhar-o-irfan karo khatm kalaam<br> (De hame is ki jaza shahe najaf shahe anaam) x2<br> Ab mile ya na mile khuld ki jageer hussain</li>
   </ol> <p>(Ho salamatei(n) dukhe dil thi mere veer hussain) x2<br> Aagayi qaid nibha kar teri hamsheer hussain</p></font>
